  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Now taking&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>Similarly&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p><p>And so on&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>n</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>r</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3279</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>n</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3279</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3279</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3279</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1093</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2186</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2187</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>7</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p>",
